      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "<h1 id=\"storyboardingandvancedv01\">Storyboarding Andvanced v01</h1>\n<p><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"howtouse\">How to use:</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>With this workflow, you can turn your scribbles and storyboard panels into final images in any style! </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>I have tested this workflow mainly with the wildcard XL model, but any other model will work as well. Just remember to adjust the sampler settings to the respective model. Also don't forget to adjust the controlnet model if you want to use an SD15 model, for example. </p>\n<br>\n<p>You can find the model here: <a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/293331/wildcardx-xl-turbo\">Wildcard Turbo XL</a>.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n\n<h2 id=\"ifyourehavingproblems\">If you're having problems:</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Don't expect it to work every time the first time. Be precise in your prompts and try out different seeds in the kSampler. </p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n<p> Post Screenshots of your error messages and workflow in the #need-help channel in our Community Discord. You will be automatically invited when you join my <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mickmumpitz\"> Patreon.</a></p>\n<br>\n<p>Feel free to share your creations in our community Discord #show-your-work.</p>",
        "markdown",
        "",
        "one_dark"
      ],
      "color": "#332922",
      "bgcolor": "#593930",
      "shape": 1
    },
